# @name Multipart File Upload
# @description Uploads a selected local file and a text field to httpbin. In Body, click Choose file for the attachment field, select a file, then send. The response echoes the uploaded file details.
# @timeout 30000

curl -X POST "https://httpbin.org/post" \
  -F 'note=Uploaded from API Client Reborn' \
  -F 'attachment=@'
